RTL9617C LuCI feed patches
========================

These patches modify the LuCI feed, not this package. Apply them after
"scripts/feeds update luci" and before building:

  ../rtl9617c-feed/apply-luci-patches.sh

- 100-rtl9617c-system-status: show the SoC temperature on the status page via
  the luci.rtl9617c-system ubus object and grant the matching ACL.
- 101-rtl9617c-resource-version: expose base_url and resource_version to the
  header template so updated static resources are not served from cache.
